   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PMU IAP Kosovo 2000-01</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PMU IOP Kosovo 2000-01</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektte &#xe4;r en forts&#xe4;ttning av husreparationer genomf&#xf6;rda av PMU i Kacanik kommun, p&#xe5; gr&#xe4;nsen mot Makedonien. Detta projekt avser rehab av ytterligare 160 krigsskadade hus, samt lokal infrastruktur. Projektgenomf&#xf6;rs under 2000-2001.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The poroject is a continuation of a Sida financed PMU project in Kacanik municipality. This project aims at reconstruction of 160 heavily war-damaged housse, and local infrastructure. It will be implemented during 2000-2001</narrative>
  </description>
